格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"从零开始，看懂 DeepSeek Harness 的「万物皆可插件」— 零基础插件开发教程（含 22 个中文技能实例）| Zero-to-plugin tutorial for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1333303761","install_available":false,"language":"Python","name":"hello-dsh","slug":"pingfanfan/hello-dsh","topics":["ai-agent","chinese","cordis","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","tutorial"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"从零开始，看懂 DeepSeek Harness 的「万物皆可插件」— 零基础插件开发教程（含 22 个中文技能实例）| Zero-to-plugin tutorial for DeepSeek Ha"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"看懂 DeepSeek Harness 的「万物皆可插件」— 零基础插件开发教程（含 22 个中文技能实例）| Zero-to-plugin tutorial for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"**The first lesson for DeepSeek Harness**"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"From \"open a terminal\" to your first plugin, in 30 minutes"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**English** · 中文 · **Start →**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"DSH introduces itself as *\"Everything is a Plugin.\"*"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"That is not marketing. Open Settings → Plugins → Plugin list and look at the count:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**133 of them.** `llm` (the model adapter), `session` (conversation history), `webserver` (the page "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"you are looking at), `ui-sidebar` (the sidebar on the left), and `agent-loop` — **the agent loop its"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"), `ui-sidebar` (the sidebar on the left), and `agent-loop` — **the agent loop itself is a plugin**."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"This repo walks you from \"open a terminal\" to building your own plugin and watching its lifecycle."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Start here"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**→ Full tutorial: Hello DSH**"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"> 🌏 **The tutorial is currently written in Chinese.** An English version is in progress.\n> The code,"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" commands, and screenshots are language-neutral, so the walkthrough is still\n> followable — and the "},{"id":"p11s3","text":"skills in `examples/skills/` work regardless of\n> what language you read.\n>\n> ⚠️ **Launch the web UI"},{"id":"p11s4","text":" with `--patch`**, or skills silently do nothing. See\n> the gotcha below."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"It assumes you have nothing: no Node.js, no command-line experience. Every section ends with a check"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"point — **you don't move on until you see the expected result**."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Steps | What | Time |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| 1–2 | Open a terminal, install Node.js | 7 min |\n| 3–5 | Launch DSH, configure the API key, pick a"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" workspace | 10 min |\n| 6 | **See all 133 plugins for yourself** | 3 min |\n| 7–8 | **Build your firs"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"t plugin, watch its lifecycle** | 10 min |\n| 9–10 | What's next, theory (optional) | 13 min |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Steps 1–8 take about 30 minutes and leave you with a working setup."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Two routes to extend DSH"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Route | What you write | Effort | Good for |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| **Markdown** (skill) | One text file | 5 minutes | Changing how the model judges, formats, and wor"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ks |\n| **TypeScript** (code plugin) | A code module | 30+ minutes | New tools, external services, UI"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"ypeScript** (code plugin) | A code module | 30+ minutes | New tools, external services, UI changes |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**Rule of thumb: if you can explain it in plain language, take the Markdown route.**"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The tutorial walks through both."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Ready-made examples"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Once you're through the tutorial, `examples/skills/` has 22 Chinese-language skills ready to use."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Let an AI install them (easiest)"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Hand this link to Codex, Claude Code, or DSH itself:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"It checks Node, DSH, and the API key first, then copies files."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### Or run one command"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Preview first: `./install.sh --dry-run`\nRemove: `./install.sh --uninstall`"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### The skills"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Skill | Use it when |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| `hello-dsh` | **Start here**: verify the plugin system, lifecycle, theory |\n| `dsh-onboarding` | F"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"irst run of DSH, or stuck on startup, workspace, permissions |\n| `dsh-skill-dev` | Full rules for wr"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"iting skills (Markdown route) |\n| `dsh-first-plugin` | Building your first code plugin (tested walkt"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"hrough) |\n| `dsh-plugin-dev` | Full rules for writing plugins (TypeScript route) |\n| `dsh-troublesho"},{"id":"p32s5","text":"ot` | Won't start, config not applying, UNKNOWN_TOOL, missing skills |\n| `plan-before-code` | A task"},{"id":"p32s6","text":" spanning several files, with unknowns |\n| `code-review-cn` | Reviewing a change, PR, or diff |\n| `d"},{"id":"p32s7","text":"ebug-systematically` | A bug, a failing test, \"it worked yesterday\" |\n| `explain-codebase` | Getting"},{"id":"p32s8","text":" oriented in an unfamiliar project |\n| `refactor-safely` | Refactoring, splitting functions, removin"},{"id":"p32s9","text":"g duplication |\n| `test-first` | Writing tests, implementing a feature, fixing a bug |\n| `api-design"},{"id":"p32s10","text":"` | Designing an interface, adding a public method |\n| `error-handling` | Designing error handling, "},{"id":"p32s11","text":"throw vs return |\n| `perf-optimize` | Optimizing performance, finding what's slow |\n| `security-revi"},{"id":"p32s12","text":"ew-cn` | Security review, attack surface, credential handling |\n| `commit-message` | Writing commit "},{"id":"p32s13","text":"messages, splitting changes |\n| `pr-description` | Writing a PR description, preparing review |\n| `w"},{"id":"p32s14","text":"rite-tech-cn` | Writing Chinese docs, READMEs, technical posts |\n| `write-docs-cn` | Writing or orga"},{"id":"p32s15","text":"nizing project docs, API references |\n| `web-research` | Researching online, verifying facts, evalua"},{"id":"p32s16","text":"ting options |\n| `ask-good-questions` | Asking a technical question, reporting a bug |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Once installed, say **\"hello dsh\"** to DSH and it walks you through, one layer at a time."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## One gotcha"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"⚠️ **The DSH web UI ships with skills disabled** (the CLI profile has them on). Verified on `0.1.0-r"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"The DSH web UI ships with skills disabled** (the CLI profile has them on). Verified on `0.1.0-rc.6`."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"To use skills in the web UI:"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"That file is in this repo's root."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## What this tutorial found"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Writing this meant running DSH end to end on two clean Macs. These behaviors are documented in the t"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"utorial because each one silently blocks a beginner:"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"| Finding | Why it matters |"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"| The web profile ships with `tool-skill` and `skill-filesystem` **disabled**; `headless` has them o"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"n | Same skill works in the CLI, silently does nothing in the web UI, with no error |\n| The web UI *"},{"id":"p42s3","text":"*requires a workspace** before the send button activates | The CLI has no such requirement, so it's "},{"id":"p42s4","text":"easy to miss when testing |\n| A stale DSH process holding port 3080 makes the page **load normally**"},{"id":"p42s5","text":" | New instance exits with `EADDRINUSE`; the browser silently talks to the old one and no config cha"},{"id":"p42s6","text":"nge appears to take effect |\n| `--patch` **inserts** rather than overrides, so patched plugins mount"},{"id":"p42s7","text":" twice | Harmless, but the plugin list shows 7 skill plugins instead of 5 |\n| A camelCase frontmatte"},{"id":"p42s8","text":"r key drops the **entire skill**, warning only | Documented fail-closed behavior, but hard to diagno"},{"id":"p42s9","text":"se without knowing it |"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"All verified on `0.1.0-rc.6`."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"## Companion tool"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"`dsh-doctor` — config health checks that catch silent failures:"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"Read-only. Every rule maps to a real failure documented in DeepSeek's own docs or postmortems."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
